on upon reassignment. For a copy of Judge Thompson's Standing Order and other information, please refer to the Court's website at www.cand.uscourts.gov. Initial Case Management Conference set for 8/27/2026 at 2:00 PM in San Francisco - Videoconference Only. This proceeding will be held via a Zoom webinar. Joint Case Management Statement due by 8/20/2026. Webinar Access: All counsel, members of the public, and media may access the webinar information at https://cand.uscourts.gov/judges/tlt/thompson-trina-lCiv LR 77-3(d). Persons granted access to court proceedings held by telephone or videoconference are reminded that photographing, recording, and rebroadcasting of court proceedings, including screenshots or other visual copying of a hearing, is absolutely prohibited.Zoom Guidance and Setup: https://www.cand.uscourts.gov/zoom/. (This is a text-only entry generated by the court. There is no document associated with this entry.) (rfm, COURT USER) (Filed on 6/3/2026) (Entered: 06/03/2026)", "tags": []}, {"resource_uri": "https://www.courtlistener.com/api/rest/v4/docket-entries/466226422/", "id": 466226422, "docket": "https://www.courtlistener.com/api/rest/v4/dockets/73374407/", "recap_documents": [{"resource_uri": "https://www.courtlistener.com/api/rest/v4/recap-documents/481459959/", "id": 481459959, "tags": [], "absolute_url": "/docket/73374407/8/myers-v-pfizer-inc/", "date_created": "2026-06-03T17:01:37.492042-07:00", "date_modified": "2026-06-03T17:01:37.508893-07:00", "sha1": "", "page_count": null, "file_size": null, "filepath_local": null, "filepath_ia": "", "ia_upload_failure_count": null, "thumbnail": null, "thumbnail_status": 0, "plain_text": "", "ocr_status": null, "date_upload": null, "document_number": "8", "attachment_number": null, "pacer_doc_id": "", "is_available": false, "is_free_on_pacer": null, "is_sealed": null, "document_type": 1, "description": "", "acms_document_guid": ""}], "date_created": "2026-06-03T17:01:37.467967-07:00", "date_modified": "2026-06-03T17:01:37.475549-07:00", "date_filed": "2026-06-03", "time_filed": null, "entry_number": 8, "recap_sequence_number": "2026-06-03.003", "pacer_sequence_number": null, "description": "ORDER REASSIGNING CASE IT IS ORDERED that this case is reassigned using a proportionate, random and blind system pursuant to General Order No. 44 to Judge Trina L Thompson. Magistrate Judge Sallie Kim no longer assigned to the case. Counsel are instructed that all future filings shall bear the updated judicial initials immediately after the case number. Counsel are reminded to verify the location of the judge on the court website. All hearing and trial dates presently scheduled are vacated. However, existing briefing schedules for motions remain unchanged. Motions must be renoticed for hearing before the judge to whom the case has been reassigned, but the renoticing of the hearing does not affect the prior briefing schedule. Other deadlines such as those for ADR compliance and discovery cutoff also remain unchanged. Mark B. Busby Clerk, United States District Court (This is a text-only entry generated by the court. There is no document associated with this entry.) (tke, COURT STAFF) (Filed on 6/3/2026) (Entered: 06/03/2026)", "tags": []}, {"resource_uri": "https://www.courtlistener.com/api/rest/v4/docket-entries/466226419/", "id": 466226419, "docket": "https://www.courtlistener.com/api/rest/v4/dockets/73374407/", "recap_documents": [{"resource_uri": "https://www.courtlistener.com/api/rest/v4/recap-documents/481459957/", "id": 481459957, "tags": [], "absolute_url": "/docket/73374407/7/myers-v-pfizer-inc/", "date_created": "2026-06-03T17:01:37.432374-07:00", "date_modified": "2026-06-03T17:01:37.454712-07:00", "sha1": "", "page_count": null, "file_size": null, "filepath_local": null, "filepath_ia": "", "ia_upload_failure_count": null, "thumbnail": null, "thumbnail_status": 0, "plain_text": "", "ocr_status": null, "date_upload": null, "document_number": "7", "attachment_number": nul